{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜原生结构已编码，完整构建通过\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|流程]]\n独立 Montage 已保存回读；GA/ABP/移动集成待决，完整动作运行验收待完成。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入边界\nIA_Attack 已保存 Pressed，类型回读通过。\nASC::AbilitySpecInputPressed → WaitComboInput。\nHeroComponent 只缓存激活失败。\n[[Input/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\n继承 UGGYGOGameplayAbility，持有段序和任务。\nActivateAbility → StartStep(0)。\nTryAdvanceCombo → 窗口内消费唯一请求。\nEndAbility → 清任务/Trace，恢复 Mesh Tick。\nGA_Attack_Light 尚待改父类。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[]\n原生结构已定义，蓝图默认值待配置。\nMontage、Main/End、NextStepIndex、PlayRate、Damage/PoiseDamage、Socket/Radius。\nValidateComboConfiguration → 校验配置。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage Task\nPlayMontageAndWaitForEvent → ASC 播放。\n验证 Montage/实例 ID/ASC 所有权。\nReleaseMontageTask → 解绑回调，再 EndTask。\nSetStartTimeSeconds → 纠正播放位置。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 三份独立 Main→End Montage\n资产、FullBody、窗口已保存回读。\nNotifyState → ComboWindowBegin/End。\nHitWindowBegin/End 独立。\nABP Slot 与 GA 默认值尚未接入。\n[[Animation/结构]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero MeleeTrace / GE\nHeroCharacter 持有 MeleeTraceComponent。\n服务器 BeginTraceWindow → 清去重集合。\nOnMeleeHit → DamageEffect/Cue。\nEndTraceWindow → 停止扫掠。\nSocket/GE 配置与命中验证待完成。\n[[Combat/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WaitComboInput / ASC 纠正\n输入任务持有 SourceStep、递增 RequestId。\nGAS VectorPayload(X,Y) → 服务器验证段序与窗口。\nClientCorrectComboStep → 预测键、Revision、段/位置/窗口。\nCorrectPredictedStep → 忽略旧确认，拒绝时回退。\n联机延迟和拒绝路径尚未运行验收。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
